@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@spotId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@condominiumId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@ownerId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Listar vagas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ParkingSpots
Accept: application/json

### Buscar vaga por id (inclui links HATEOAS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ParkingSpots/{{spotId}}
Accept: application/json

### Criar vaga
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ParkingSpots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "A-02",
  "type": "Standard",
  "location": "Subsolo 1",
  "isAvailable": true,
  "description": "Vaga cadastrada pela API",
  "condominiumId": "{{condominiumId}}",
  "ownerId": "{{ownerId}}"
}

### Atualizar vaga
# O ID informado na URL deve ser o mesmo ID enviado no JSON.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ParkingSpots/{{spotId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{spotId}}",
  "number": "A-01",
  "type": "Standard",
  "location": "Subsolo 1 - atualizado",
  "isAvailable": false,
  "description": "Vaga atualizada",
  "condominiumId": "{{condominiumId}}",
  "ownerId": "{{ownerId}}"
}

### Excluir vaga
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ParkingSpots/{{spotId}}
